{"summary":true,"limitations":{"RQ1":"Original-viewer reading is restricted to the locked P08 and P09 artifacts read-only without opening underlying PDFs or claiming exhaustive corpus inspection; qualitative partitioning categories reflect only documented evidence-base examples, do not treat unreported mechanisms as absent, and do not establish empirical performance outcomes.","RQ2":"Original-viewer verification is limited to the locked P08 and P09 records without inspecting full primary PDFs; reported formulations and evaluation parameters reflect documented study scope rather than exhaustive modeling coverage, unreported parameters do not imply absence, and qualitative comparisons do not establish actual optimization outcomes.","RQ3":"Original-viewer inspection is bounded to the locked P08 and P09 artifacts without reopening primary PDFs or asserting exhaustive coverage of the evidence base; any retained quantitative matrix scope is not summarized numerically here, missing reporting does not indicate absence, and extracted metrics cannot be conflated with real-world operational outcomes.","RQ4":"Original-viewer reading covers only the locked P08 and P09 records without direct inspection of primary PDFs; mobility, link-interruption, and failure-recovery findings reflect the specific simulated or controlled evidence-base setups rather than exhaustive field coverage, unreported fault modes do not constitute absence, and experimental behaviors do not establish live flight outcomes.","RQ5":"Original-viewer review is confined to the locked P08 and P09 files without opening underlying PDFs or claiming complete corpus access; synthesis of open challenges and validation gaps is bounded by what the evidence base explicitly reports, unreported limitations do not imply absence, and identified gaps remain distinct from observed deployment outcomes."},"tools":[],"workers_used":false,"unresolved":[]}
